      "text": "<h1><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Insignia<sup>®</sup></span> Hip Stem</span></span></h1>\n<p><br>\n<span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">The Insignia hip stem leverages more than 1,300 CT scans, utilizing a 3D modeling and analytics system, Stryker Orthopaedic Modeling and Analytics (SOMA) bone database and is engineered to optimize fit and function.<sup>1</sup>&nbsp;Designed with the principles of implant fit, function and flexibility, Insignia is your collared, metaphyseal-filling hip stem designed for ease of insertion, especially during muscle-sparing approaches.</span></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
